    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“It is not over. That is not optimism. That is doctrine.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The Star (Hopebringer).</strong> You are morale after catastrophe, the refusal to collapse, the dangerous force that makes people try again when the math says they should not.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype strengthens inspiration, cohesion, and recovery after losses. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Soft Power</strong> and <strong>+1 Culture</strong> in faction calculus.</li><li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit.</li></ul>",
